        "id": 117901,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-28T18:37:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Really, what matters I think is whether or not you've seen any of the deck. If the deck is randomized, then shuffling it won't make it any more random. If you've set cards in certain spots, like with Foresight or whatever, or seen it because of looking through the deck, then you have to shuffle.</p>",
